<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Resource Bancshares started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Resource Bancshares started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it started coverage of Resource Bancshares Mortgage Group Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Estimates 1996 earnings at $1.21 per share and 1997 earnings at $1.57 per share.</p>
<p>-- Said company &quot;appears to be significantly undervalued&quot; and sees possibility of 35 percent or more appreciation in shares over the next 12 to 14 months.</p>
<p>-- Warned that a sharp increase in interest rates would affect earnings outlook.</p>
<p>-- No first trade yet reported in shares.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
